{"3644850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Echoes of Shadows: The Last Jinyiwei", "steam_appid": 3644850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>&quot;In this darkness, your loyalty is no longer to the Emperor’s command — but to your own faith.&quot;</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕹️ <strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two paths to victory</strong> – master stealth or engage in direct combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear sandbox missions</strong> – multiple routes, multiple assassination methods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ assassination animations</strong> – combo chains and environmental kills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic plague system</strong> – enemies evolve with the changing world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> – choices and sacrifices shape your destiny</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔪 <strong>Stealth Without Limits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/extras/3b149b775682e4db53cabd414678813a.poster.avif?t=1768265203\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/extras/3b149b775682e4db53cabd414678813a.webm?t=1768265203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/extras/3b149b775682e4db53cabd414678813a.mp4?t=1768265203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate any way you choose. Slip past patrols, exploit terrain, set traps — or kick down the front door and fight your way through.<br>There’s no “right” way to complete a mission. Every assassination is a battle of strategy, patience, and timing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ <strong>Assassination &amp; Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/extras/6a9cf3182f0e7d1d0136e6d7d8455595.poster.avif?t=1768265203\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/extras/6a9cf3182f0e7d1d0136e6d7d8455595.webm?t=1768265203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/extras/6a9cf3182f0e7d1d0136e6d7d8455595.mp4?t=1768265203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From silent kills with a dagger to long-range bow shots, from poisoned blades to deadly throwing knives — chain your attacks with environmental hazards to craft your perfect kill route.<br>Adapt, improvise, and strike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧟‍♂️ <strong>A World Changed by Plague</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/extras/f65b73af18e5024750aa96d7108c80d4.poster.avif?t=1768265203\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/extras/f65b73af18e5024750aa96d7108c80d4.webm?t=1768265203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644850/extras/f65b73af18e5024750aa96d7108c80d4.mp4?t=1768265203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The plague twists both body and mind. Infected enemies fight with unpredictable aggression, while human factions clash for control of the collapsing world.<br>Every step forward changes the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👧 <s